# steps: 1.1 形式の行番号、Do part、増減、To step、for
1.1 Type "X VALUES"
1.2 Set x = 2
1.3 Type x*2, x/2, x^2, x^3
Do part 1
1.15 Set x = 3
Type part 1
Do part 1
Delete step 1.2
Type part 1
# To step で繰り返す
2.1 Set n = 0
2.2 Set n = n + 1
2.3 Type n
2.4 To step 2.2 if n < 3
Do part 2
# for で値の範囲を回す: 1(1)5 は 1 から 5 まで 1 ずつ
3.1 Type i, i*i
Do part 3 for i = 1(1)5
# Done で part から戻る
4.1 Type "four"
4.2 Done
4.3 Type "never"
5.1 Do part 4
5.2 Type "back"
Do part 5
